{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "944e3b97b86aff489cac3189de5f8a034597faeb2d05be23ae09e483cc3a461c", "ja": "無敵の☆★コンビネゾン", "zh": "无敌的☆★连体裤", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e1e580ee1579dac7c6ad6f25b16efa213148528e7e8255aee8993d9a22793f63", "ja": "撮影は終了、後は雑誌の発売と人気投票を待\nつばかり。コンビとして悩みを乗り越えたふ\nたりは余裕の表情だったが、美奈子の料理を\n食べ過ぎた奈緒は衣装が入らなくなっている\nと気付く。急げ、ダイエット！", "zh": "拍摄结束，接下来只需等待杂志发售和人气投票。作为组合克服烦恼的两人一脸从容，但吃了太多美奈子的料理，奈绪发现演出服已经穿不下了。快点，减肥！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7c7b5ab750bbf9b03a34c9e7b0d6c2ae1b66826d15272325fbfedfc0e2e56c7c", "ja": "（美奈子と奈緒の撮影は無事に終了し、\n『e-m-girl』はいよいよ明日発売となった）", "zh": "（美奈子和奈绪的拍摄顺利结束，《e-m-girl》终于要在明天发售了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_06_1001_p", "source_sha256": "d2f8458ed1c5c37aba7e9591b9ce2629fde0a52573085de8537b31a4ad63bd41", "ja": "（業界内での注目度も高く、ふたりが出演する\nイベントのチケットは、早くもソールドアウトだ！）", "zh": "（她们在业内也备受瞩目，两人出演的活动门票已经早早售罄了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_06_1002_p", "source_sha256": "d5757d42fe36f6ea41cacf5d50f719d5f89d79b61882814bf2e738de8fdaf930", "ja": "（あとは発売と、人気投票の結果を待つのみだけど。\n肝心のふたりが、妙に落ち着いているような……）", "zh": "（接下来只要等待发售和人气投票的结果了。不过，关键的两个人似乎异常冷静……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_06_1003_037nao", "source_sha256": "06032cf21fa8adef8a71028b0ee1cc5736e617634201f6ac23fab2beaf377620", "ja": "なあなあ、美奈子！　今日、あのドーナツ屋さんの前\n通ってきてんけど、テレビの取材来とったで？", "zh": "喂喂，美奈子！今天我经过那家甜甜圈店门口时，看到电视台来采访了哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_06_1004_019min", "source_sha256": "e797c5e946a71ff3c7ebf04c2be8cf04ab113a470a527004893e6954146fca87", "ja": "えっ！　じゃあ、混んじゃうよね……\n今のうちに行っておこう、奈緒ちゃん！", "zh": "咦！那样的话，肯定会变得很拥挤吧……\n趁现在赶紧去吧，奈绪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_06_1005_p", "source_sha256": "a19c6af45023d0799530f5b402da0c3504a00da042860d32d5dd1733df64698a", "ja": "ふたりとも、お疲れさま！\nずいぶんと落ち着いてるというか、余裕だな。", "zh": "两位都辛苦了！  \n还真是沉着冷静，或者说，显得很从容啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_06_1006_p", "source_sha256": "efa86a8ec01a35df0839ad3394b1e05e72de1d1f8df4778d9c449b14453da998", "ja": "人気投票は、これからだろ？\n緊張してるんじゃないかと思ったんだが……。", "zh": "人气投票不是要从现在开始吗？\n我还以为你们会紧张……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_06_1007_019min", "source_sha256": "45d2214d621eadc2d0459deb035f26bb3224d8a2114aaf64c1d3179841ccb52e", "ja": "緊張してないわけじゃないんですけど……\nでも、もうすぐ劇場の公演もありますし。", "zh": "也不是不紧张，只是……\n不过，剧场公演也马上就要开始了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_06_1008_037nao", "source_sha256": "55f3e8faa54d366644b7847276c752d50c0bc338fcd1b0ad2ab260c83de43036", "ja": "そうそう。私ら、やれることはやりましたし。\n結果は、「果報は寝て待て」ってやつです！", "zh": "对对，我们该做的都做了。结果嘛，就像俗话说的“好消息要耐心等”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_06_1009_p", "source_sha256": "04798092eb989781a23da5dd3ffe28dcdcd193ebbc01dcad466dd75d9f2076cc", "ja": "はは、そうか。そういえばスタイリストさんが、\nふたりの事を褒めてたよ。写真、すごく良かったって。", "zh": "哈哈，这样啊。对了，造型师还夸你们俩来着，说照片拍得特别好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_06_1010_037nao", "source_sha256": "b8fd794731d0e569def4ff993795ed62f26d3430e2c60827e18378623b72f75f", "ja": "ホンマですか！？　えっへっへ……\nこれも、読モ師匠のスパルタ特訓のおかげやんな♪", "zh": "真的吗！？嘿嘿嘿……\n这也多亏了读者模特师父的魔鬼特训呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_06_1011_019min", "source_sha256": "504ec495be511fbd46341aeb09bbb31e496c3fcc20fb466518dd3d3063769b8b", "ja": "うんうん。撮影は、まだ少し緊張しちゃうけど。\n特訓のおかげで、ちょっと鍛えられた気がする！", "zh": "嗯嗯。拍摄的时候还是会有点紧张。\n不过多亏了特训，感觉自己稍微变强了一点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_06_1012_037nao", "source_sha256": "dc76558a8467e35c1559682225070b822d23248bb7c295f07039d1952b9614fc", "ja": "服選びの時とか、メッチャ助かりましたわ～。\nあ。そういえば、美奈子はどんな服選んだん？", "zh": "挑选服装的时候，帮了我大忙呢～。\n啊，对了，美奈子选了什么样的衣服？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_06_1013_019min", "source_sha256": "7433cb236ed3788bf7233aba6544da4eb546780ab8dddc77cd75ec2aabf7db7c", "ja": "私はちょっと大人っぽく、きれいめのトップスと\nスカートだよ。奈緒ちゃんは？", "zh": "我选了稍微成熟一点的漂亮上衣和裙子。奈绪呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_06_1014_037nao", "source_sha256": "494b21af687c76e8c991945c06f196b0c983c3855f70f263b430700035d2b945", "ja": "私は、クールにモノトーンで攻めてみてん！\n……って、これもみんなの受け売りなんやけどな。", "zh": "我就来走酷酷的黑白风！……不过，这也是照搬大家说过的话啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_06_1015_037nao", "source_sha256": "1e1f55ac320130cc1ac56fe8ad80b79961f10bad696d04f7e30f0a91b315f66d", "ja": "せやけど、けっこう自信あるし。\nどっちが勝っても、文句なしやで？", "zh": "不过我还是挺有自信的。\n不管谁赢，都没意见吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_06_1016_019min", "source_sha256": "d741a528164838c917f9652851e671de677f0a55a7a80fca6e502e4939446a93", "ja": "うん！　私だって、絶対に負けないよっ！", "zh": "嗯！我也绝对不会输的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_06_1017_037nao", "source_sha256": "c2b55926497a1ffc172837d9d4f01f84bca4f5516af0ce7ada4c97ac625196e8", "ja": "よっしゃ！　この調子で\n劇場の公演もイベントも、盛り上げていくでー！", "zh": "好嘞！就照这个劲头，\n把剧场的公演和活动的气氛都搞起来吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_06_1018_019min", "source_sha256": "0522f5feb089c6d0ce8700a3a14d006211d88ef37bf2eed6509b13d9b6b2b377", "ja": "おー！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_06_1019_037nao", "source_sha256": "32e8fd3cb785057b92ea58b0f3280d3555ccbc32aa058104ea7f4384966083dc", "ja": "せや！\n私、ちょっと衣装を試着してきますわ。", "zh": "是呀！\n我先去试穿一下服装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_06_1020_p", "source_sha256": "a71e7ef88dc68ff111760d37e607c67496d4563c609b7346248815a04aebcaa9", "ja": "衣装って、ユニットのか？", "zh": "衣装是指组合的那套吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_06_1021_037nao", "source_sha256": "0e03a09d258cf7922232ad7861494368b13d3b2b169e2abe64cf02fedb5e3a8a", "ja": "はい！　あの衣装、めっちゃ体にピッタリなんで、\n本番で着られへんかったら困るし。", "zh": "是啊！那套服装特别合身，要是正式演出时穿不了就麻烦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_06_1022_019min", "source_sha256": "1a5b6d53c03b4b79e90ef61d2c48de757f084dd5a20d9e4ee47c4ae4e11f9431", "ja": "あ、私も一緒に行くよ！", "zh": "啊，我也一起去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_06_1023_p", "source_sha256": "ac8d231318358773eee8c5e765cd8523c89696e1df7e776195b831c6202f1698", "ja": "（友達であり、ライバルでもあるユニット……。\nふたりとも、この仕事で一回り成長した気がするな！）", "zh": "（既是朋友，也是对手的组合……感觉两个人都通过这次工作成长了一大截呢！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_06_1024_037nao", "source_sha256": "f11d63c9a26deba70f2f1b23dd7d1e284182bf289829f5f765d41663247dd28a", "ja": "アカーーーン！！", "zh": "不行啊——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_06_1025_p", "source_sha256": "f5c2351a5c252371b3167500aaa8c0e3c9d0654b94b2005e4ed0b1e9e25f5dfd", "ja": "な、なんだ、どうしたんだ！？\nすごい声が聞こえたけど……。", "zh": "怎、怎么了，发生什么事了！？\n我听到好大的声音……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_06_1026_037nao", "source_sha256": "3d6fee9d6726bc2731c120b7ab0d6a28e4c42e0dff28c43b469bbfafef48d30d", "ja": "アカン、衣装が入らへん……ど、どないしよう！？\nこれって、レッスンの後食べ過ぎたから……？", "zh": "不行，服装穿不进去……怎、怎么办啊！？\n难道是因为练习后吃得太多了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_06_1027_019min", "source_sha256": "531d751d0d07884d3d0a97b53069e8c501f5ac91f118d009a5a8697cd20c5d29", "ja": "ええっ！？\nもしかして、私……盛りすぎちゃった！？", "zh": "诶！？难道是我……盛得太多了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_06_1028_p", "source_sha256": "6bc9c13519744f9856eece135256366068a7c83c7ba0369a9161f9893a0d5767", "ja": "ふたりとも、何やってるんだ？\nレッスンの後って、まさか……。", "zh": "你们两个在干什么？\n难道说，训练结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_06_1029_037nao", "source_sha256": "e3b4efb566aed2c735e67b0b61fb3047de0e2a23a45ebaa2cd31c0adbdac1a5d", "ja": "いや、読モ師匠のレッスンが厳しかったんで、\n終わる度に腹ペコになってもうて、つい……。", "zh": "哎，因为读者模特师父的训练太严格了，每次结束后都饿得肚子空空的，一不小心就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_06_1030_037nao", "source_sha256": "510797d300e6fd995c82fc759f36867cd2837698d20ac5a90560a3fc1b0a1161", "ja": "ううっ、こうなったらダイエット……\nって、本番まであと1週間もないー！", "zh": "呜呜，这下只能减肥了……等等，距离正式演出连1周都不到——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_06_1031_019min", "source_sha256": "d5ec0eee82d34942a85a57aeb65b569e7ba7c1e18a3ed054d0b303e13baebcec", "ja": "わ、私、ダイエット手伝うよ！　そうだ、カロリーの\n低いものをたくさん食べよう！　私、作ってくるっ！", "zh": "我、我来帮你减肥吧！对了，只要吃\n很多低卡路里的东西就行了！我这就去给你做！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_06_1032_p", "source_sha256": "a38f34185abbb56d744d9ccd7bed47d41e599c4d18ea6266f36addc376409345", "ja": "待て待て、食べるな！　食べないで運動しなさい！", "zh": "等等、别吃！别吃东西，去运动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
